WEBVTT

00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,920
This is a quick walkthrough to show you how to log in to Conor's Clinic.

00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:06,160
First, we'll look at the member site.

00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:09,560
So on Conor's Clinic.com at the top, you'll see members.

00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:14,160
If you click on that, it'll bring you to members.conor's clinic.com.

00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,080
So you can just type that in directly.

00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:17,840
It'll bring you directly to the login page.

00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:23,040
You're not going to use the traditional email and password for any of our logins.

00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:26,920
If you scroll down, we're going to use the password list log in.

00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:31,880
So what happens is you type in your email, check the box, click on email link.

00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,040
It'll send you a link to your email.

00:00:35,040 --> 00:00:39,080
So go to your inbox, check the email that we sent you, and there'll be a link.

00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:43,800
You click on it, you'll bring your rate back to this member site, and you'll be logged in.

00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:48,680
So we don't use email password, you just put in your email address, click the button,

00:00:48,680 --> 00:00:53,680
go check your email, click the link, and it'll bring you back, and you'll be logged in.

00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:58,480
For courses, you can just go directly to courses.conor's clinic.com,

00:00:58,480 --> 00:01:01,440
or you can get there from the link on our website.

00:01:01,440 --> 00:01:05,160
Same thing, click log in at the top here.

00:01:05,160 --> 00:01:10,400
Same log in page, kind of same look, go down to the bottom, put your email address in,

00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:12,840
click the link in your email, and it'll bring you back.

00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:17,600
And you'll be on the courses page again, come down, you can click on access course,

00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:22,160
and then you'll be able to scroll through all the modules.

00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:30,400
Also, for our store, you can get there from this link, or you can go directly to shop.conorsclinic.com.

00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:36,400
Up here, click on the icon, click log in, and this is a little different, similar concept.

00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:39,200
So you're going to just, there's no password, you're going to type in your email address,

00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:44,880
it continue, go to your email, and there'll be an email, instead of a link, there'll be a code.

00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:49,680
Copy the code, come back here, and paste it in.

00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:54,240
Or it'll, I think it might have a link also, but if you come back here, this will be a spot to

00:01:54,240 --> 00:01:58,880
paste the code, and then hit enter, and that will log you into the store.

00:01:58,880 --> 00:02:03,440
So with all of our sites, we upgraded to the newer, more secure, instead of using the email and

00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:08,640
password, it's sending a link to your email to be able to get in.

00:02:08,640 --> 00:02:11,920
So if you have any questions, obviously you can reach out to us.

